WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Atmospheric Synthwave and Echoing Heartbeat Intro]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Walking through Bluewater Plaza

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Feeling safe and feeling free

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.500
Zoe's hand is in my left one

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:59.000
Sarah's hand is holding me

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
We pass a shop, a window

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Made in white, a little crib

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:17.000
A mobile, soft and gentle light

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:22.000
A fragile thought I've never had

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.000
A future I can see, a tiny hand to hold in mine

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
A part of them and me

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.000
But then the cold comes rushing in

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:40.000
The fear I've always known

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.000
The only lesson I was taught, the seed that she has sown

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.000
What if I'm like her?

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:54.000
What if I have her seed?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.000
What if I don't know how to love?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.500
What if I only know her creed?

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:08.000
I have no map for this new road

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.000
I have no one to trace

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:18.000
What if I'm like her, and I just fail this place?

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:38.000
[Soaring Synthwave Lead Interlude]

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:45.000
My father is a ghost I've never met, killed before I was born

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:52.000
My mother, she was just a storm of calculated scorn

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:59.000
She never gave, she only took, she never held me tight

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:06.000
How can I give them sunshine when all I knew was night?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:11.000
What if I'm like her?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:16.000
What if I have her seed?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:21.000
What if I don't know how to love?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:25.500
What if I only know her creed?

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:30.000
I have no map for this new road

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.000
I have no one to trace

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.000
What if I'm like her, and I just fail this place?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:54.000
[Melodic Synthwave Solo]

00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:00.000
I'm tensing up, my hands are tight, a white-knuckled mistake

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:06.000
This newfound joy is all too bright, it's more than I can take

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:12.000
I see the crib, I see her face

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.000
I'm in a scary place

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:27.000
What if I'm like her?

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:36.000
What if I'm like her?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:05:20.840
[Sweeping Synthwave & Guitar Finale]
